      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T07:21:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In Gerrit this means, synchronous response writes used for Git/HTTP traffic (e.g. git-upload-pack / git-receive-pack), where the Jetty worker thread is parked until the client consumes data.\n\nI have updated the commit message.",
